{"version":1,"content":"<p>前AV女優濱崎真緒引退後，以「DJ Mao」身分在亞洲各地從事DJ工作，早前更殺入電視圈，參演HOY劇集《你的保安 李寶安》。</p><p>昨晚（10月31日）萬聖節，濱崎真緒在凌晨5點多於社交平台突然發文，自揭「工作中給人下藥了。</p><p>」帖文附兩張相片，一張是她坐在輪椅上，身旁有警員，另一張她已在救護車擔架牀。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:51.021196+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T03:52:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:44.902439+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771179+00:00","content_hash":"10c35a0b33e174b01586f14ec4fb1e1bfd80efd8862f2263588a865afd2dba5a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}